------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled model
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This module embeds the "Rampart" on-device PII detection model:

    Rampart — Client-side PII redaction for AI assistants
    Copyright 2026 National Design Studio
    https://huggingface.co/nationaldesignstudio/rampart

The model is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
License (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The bundled artifacts derived from the model — weights.bin (repackaged, without
modification to the underlying weights, from the model's onnx/model_q4.onnx via
internal/modelgen) and vocab.txt (redistributed unmodified) — are subject to
CC BY 4.0. Attribution to National Design Studio must be retained on
redistribution.

The model is a BertForTokenClassification network fine-tuned on
ai4privacy/pii-masking-openpii-1.5m, derived from the base model
nreimers/MiniLM-L6-H384-uncased.
